# keycloak-deploy/ is its own build context, so everything in it is sent to the
# daemon. Only two files are inputs to the image; everything else is denied.
#
# Allowlist, not denylist: an ignore file cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory was excluded, so the two files that are needed are named explicitly
# rather than excluded by pattern.
*
!Dockerfile
!realm-export.json
